        "TileImage": "$($repository 7af86858-df9d-478b-b5d8-803379cd165f).Image",
        "Description": "47, today&apos;s contract involves a neighborhood competition gone foul. Our client has issued a contract to...remove the current Grillmaster of Whittleton Creek, as well as two of the next contenders. Richard Wilson, the Grillmaster, is in charge of a moving in party. Jerold Fryar, a local construction worker, is second in line, who is known for grilling delicious glizzies. In third, is Nelson Lefayette, a man disguising as a nurse but is really trying to steal a Soviet recipe from Janus. Good luck.",
